---
layout: base.njk
title: My favorite gear
description: The tried-and-true gear I actually pack for solo mom adventures with my kid.
---
<section class="wrap-narrow" style="text-align:center;">
  <p class="eyebrow">Tried and true</p>
  <h1 class="page-title">My Favorite Gear</h1>
  <p class="page-sub">Everything here is something I actually use on our trips. No fluff, only the stuff that earns its spot in the car.</p>
  <div class="buttons" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
    {% include "amazon-btn.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap section">
  {% if collections.gear.length %}
  <div class="cards">
    {% for item in collections.gear %}
    <a class="card" href="{{ item.data.link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <div class="card-img">
        {% if item.data.image %}
          <img src="{{ item.data.image }}" alt="{{ item.data.name }}" loading="lazy" />
        {% else %}
          <div class="card-img-fallback" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <h3>{{ item.data.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ item.data.blurb }}</p>
        <p class="card-cta">Shop it</p>
      </div>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% else %}
  <p class="page-sub" style="text-align:center;">My gear list is coming soon. Check back shortly.</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>
